"How many particles each band sends per analysis frame (30 a second), drawn from its frequencies in proportion to their energy, so a strong one gathers several into one bright bead. More fill the streaks and clouds; fewer leave single beads." = "How many particles each band sends per analysis frame (30 a second), drawn from its frequencies in proportion to their energy, so a strong one gathers several into one bright bead. More fill the streaks and clouds; fewer leave single beads.";
